---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 120
    rankSpacing: 160
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 18px
    padding: 50
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    %% actors
    User(["fa:fa-user <br/> <b>AI Engineer</b> <br/> <small>[Person]</small>"]):::person
    AgentClient(["fa:fa-robot <br/> <b>Agentic Client</b> <br/> <small>[Software System]</small>"]):::actor
    CICD(["fa:fa-gears <br/> <b>CI/CD Runner</b> <br/> <small>[Software System]</small>"]):::actor


    %% components
    Vigilo["fa:fa-terminal <br/> <b>Vigilo</b> <br/> <small>[Container: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Provides evaluator and run management functionality via CLI.</small>"]:::component
    Coordinator["fa:fa-compass <br/> <b>Coordinator</b> <br/> <small>[Container: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Recovers durable work, dispatches chunk windows, finalizes runs, and publishes outbox records.</small>"]:::component
    Worker["fa:fa-gear <br/> <b>Worker</b> <br/> <small>[Container: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Consumes chunk-ready broker messages, claims chunks, invokes the agent target and evaluators, and persists results.</small>"]:::component
    Database[("<b>Database Placements</b> <br/> <small>[Container: PostgreSQL]</small> <br/> <small>Store control metadata and routed execution data across one or more placements.</small>")]:::component
    Queue[("<b>Queue</b> <br/> <small>[Container: RabbitMQ]</small> <br/> <small>Stores and distributes routed broker messages.</small>")]:::component

    Objects[("<b>Object Storage</b> <br/> <small>[Container: Blob Service]</small> <br/> <small>Stores immutable case batches, indexes, and manifests.</small>")]:::component

    %% system boundary
    subgraph VigiloSystem["&nbsp;"]
        Vigilo
        Coordinator
        Worker
        Database
        Queue
        Objects
    end
    style VigiloSystem stroke-dasharray: 5 5,fill:none,stroke:#1168bd,stroke-width:2px

    %% external target
    TargetAgent["fa:fa-brain <br/> <b>Agent / AI Provider</b> <br/> <small>[External System]</small> <br/> <small>The model, agent wrapper, or API endpoint being evaluated</small>"]:::external

    %% edges
    User & AgentClient -->|"Manages evaluators, runs and runtime services using"| Vigilo
    CICD -->|Creates runs and <br/> gates deployments via| Vigilo
    Vigilo -->|"Reads from <br/> and writes to <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database
    Vigilo -->|"Starts and stops <br/> service of type"| Coordinator
    Vigilo -->|"Starts and stops <br/> service of type"| Worker
    Coordinator -->|"Reads from <br/> and writes to <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database
    Coordinator -->|"Publishes routed chunk-ready broker messages to <br> <small>[JSON/AMQP]</small>"| Queue
    Queue -->|"Delivers routed chunk-ready broker messages to <br> <small>[JSON/AMQP]</small>"| Worker
    Worker -->|"Reads from <br/> and writes to <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database
    Worker -->|"Sends case prompts to and receives agent responses from <br> <small>[TEXT/HTTP]</small>"| TargetAgent

    Vigilo -->|Publishes verified datasets and run plans through adapters| Objects
    Coordinator -->|Resumes publication and reads verified plans| Objects
    Worker -->|Retrieves and verifies assigned case batches| Objects

